Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:33.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《谍影重重2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 这次不是训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clear on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可是来真的 行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a live project. you're a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练结束 训练结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training is over. Training is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练结束 训练结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training is over. Training is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:27.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印度 果阿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有点头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的额头很烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,头疼而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想起什么新的事情了么？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything new? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一些破碎的片断\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到康克林的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear Conklin's voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:03:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那张相片 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's that photograph, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚持不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't stay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许只是场噩梦而已 - 它发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you're sure it's not just a bad dream? - It happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把它写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两年了 我们一直在这个本子上记录着 - 还不到两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two years we're scribbling in that notebook… - It hasn't been two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没有任何好转 翻来覆去都是同样的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always bad, and now it's just the same thing over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才要把它记下来啊 因为你早晚会想起一些好的事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's Why we write it down. Because sooner or later, you remember something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确记得一些好的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do remember something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:39.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最后一次检查 - 全体注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want one final go around. - All teams listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备做最后一次检查 - 二队 看到目标立刻向我报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are standing by fiorfinal green. - Survey Two, I need to know when you've got eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是二队 我看到了 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Survey Two. I have eyes. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队 这里是总部 你们看到目标了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survey One, this is Hub. Do you have visual contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 这里是一队 一号目标正在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hub, this is Survey One. Mobile One is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,三队 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survey Three, that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总部 - 马歇尔局长 从兰利打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hub. - Director Marshal from Langley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.55,0:05:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰利 - 请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Langley. - Stand by, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马丁？- 是我 还有唐尼和杰克·韦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Martin? - I'm here. So is Donnie and Jack Weller.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你把全部的拨款都用上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand you're using the full allocation for this buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是刚刚开始 - 这可是一大笔钱啊 帕姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's where we came out. - It's a lot of money, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个小偷 一个间谍来说是一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a thief, a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是如果真能找出疑犯的名单 这值十倍的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it does nothing more than narrow the list of suspects, it's a bargain at 10 times the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 这里是二队 护送离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hub, this is Survey Two. Escort is breaking off…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号目标进入大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile One is entering the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 交易就要开始了 恕我直言 没有什么好讨论的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, I have the seller on-site and in play. Quite frankly, there's nothing much more to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 帕姆 交给你了 - 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, Pam. your call. - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们开始了 - 仅用语音联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're on. - Audio contact only.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在切到一号频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching to channel one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. It's affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 东西带来了么？- 带来了 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 一号目标和卖家已经进入办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hub, Mobile One and seller have entered the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在这儿了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在这儿了 这些文件能证明谁偷了你们的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队 请回话 一队 发生了什么事？你们看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survey One, come in. Survey One, I need to know what happened. What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到有影子么？我什么都没看到 - 你们看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you see any shadows? I see nothing. - What is yourvisual?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派人过去 快！- 快去 库尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get some men in there. Get some men in there right now. - Pull it up, Kurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有看到任何动静？一号 请回话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eye contact. I don't care If it's visual… Mobile One, can you copy, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到吗？一号？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you there, Mobile One? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在柏林举行的石油协会年度会议…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Petroleum Association's annual conference here in Berlin…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是佩克斯石油公司的首席执行官尤里·格列特科夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Pekos Oil chief executive officer Yuri Gretkov.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在短短6年时间内 格列特科夫把佩克斯变成了一个石油帝国 因而…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In just six years, Gretkovhas turned Pekos into an oil empire, which in turn…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也成为俄国最富有的人之一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's become one of the wealthiest men in Russia…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巩固了里海石油开采权并控制了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}after consolidating drilling rights in the Caspian Sea and gaining control of one ofthe wo…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,文件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成以后再给你剩下的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得洗个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧时间 飞机一小时后起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报准确吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在那儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 先生 - 早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, sir. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友 他家里有亲戚去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is my friend. There's been a death in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你有没有见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder If you've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我们暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - We're blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会？- 我们在一个地方呆得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - We pushed it. We got lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第二次见到这个家伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's twice now I've seen the same guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在城里见过他 在电报局里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him in town. He was at the telegraph office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？你怎么能确定呢？- 肯定有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? How-How can you be sure? - It's just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家伙 他开的车 他穿的衣服 肯定有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy, the car he's driving, what he's wearing… it's just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰森 听着 冷静一点 可能是别人 - 这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Jason, let's stay calm. It could be anybody. - This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 是他 他就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real. That's him. That's him right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.55,0:14:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下 银色现代车 低下头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your head down. Silver Hyundai. Get your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,多远？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,100米\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 握着方向盘 你来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take the wheel. you're gonna drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直往大桥那里开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just head to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里转弯 从田里穿过去 - 坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn here. Cut through the field. - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你继续往家里开 我一小时后去和你碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you keep going to the shack. I'll meet you there in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在桥的那一头下车 他只可能走这条路才能跟上咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bail out on the other side of this bridge. It's the only way he can follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他不是你认为的人呢？- 就是他们 是「踩石」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What If it's not who you think it is? - It's them. It's Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰森 不要这么做 - 玛丽 我警告过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jason, don't do it. - Look, Marie, I warned 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不希望你这么做 - 我告诉过他们 如果不放过我们会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want you to do it. - I told them what would happen If they didn't leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样永远都不会结束 我不希望… - 我们没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's never gonna be over like this. I don't want… - We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:19:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,电源线上放置了两个炸弹 其中一个失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of these explosive charges placed on the power lines, and one of them failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是没有爆炸的那个上面留下的指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fingerprints from the one that didn't go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找不到和指纹相符的德国人？- 是的 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the Germans can't match it? - No. Nobody's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有能查的数据库都查过了 只有兰利的数据库进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked out every database we could access. But we're hooked into Langley now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 运行一下 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「踩石」是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备飞机 我们去兰利\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get me a flight. We're going to Langley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:39.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谢列梅捷沃国际机场 俄罗斯 莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经没有余地…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了 伯恩 文件 指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个月后再和你联系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了两个人 三百万现金没了 奈斯基的文件也没拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men dead, three million in cash gone, no Neski files,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还搞得人人皆知\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all very public.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还算是一个秘密机构吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is still a clandestine agency, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这次事件并不是一次失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't view this event as a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难道这叫成功？- 我们有了一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you call it a success? - We have a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.45,0:22:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手留下了一个指纹 他是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fingerprint left by the assassin. He's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？- 关于「踩石」 你能告诉我多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - What can you tell me about Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「踩石」？- 线索正是在此中断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Treadstone?" - It's where the trail dead-ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要答案 就必须给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want an answer, you're going to have to give me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,五级S.C.I.权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}a level-five S.C.I. access.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的有线索 马蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lead, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你获准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. you've got your clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你将受到严格的监控\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're on a very short leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要向我们提供完整的报告 我要了解你们的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll give a full report to the group. I wanna know where you're going with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:10.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（意大利 那不勒斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.00,0:24:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.37,0:24:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes? - Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.11,0:24:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 帕姆 有什么可以帮忙的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pam. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望你有时间和我见一面 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was hoping you had some time for me. - Time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实际上 我现在就有空 - 听起来不像是好事嘛 让我查一下日程安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm free right now, actually. - That sounds ominous. Let me check my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.06,0:24:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我要 呃… - 有什么需要帮忙的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. I need to, uh… - Excuse me. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.59,0:24:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 我是来见艾博特先生的 - 二十分钟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm here to see Mr.Abbott. - Twenty minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「踩石」行动 - 我从来没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operation Treadstone. - Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.01,0:24:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它总不会凭空消失吧 - 恕我冒昧 帕姆 我认为你也许无权过问这些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not gonna fly. - With all due respect, Pam, I think you might've wandered past your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有马歇尔局长的授权 可以不受限制地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a warrant from Director Marshall granting me unrestricted access to…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.55,0:25:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查与「踩石」有关的所有人员和材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}all personnel and materials associated with Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.52,0:25:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 你想知道什么？- 我想了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what are we looking at? - I wanna know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.09,0:25:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解它？这是一个杀手小队 以黑对黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know about it? It was a kill squad. Black-on-black.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两年前把它解散了 这里没人想要了解「踩石」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We closed it down two years ago. Nobody wants to know about Treadstone. Not around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.73,0:25:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我认为你最好把这个带回去给马蒂 让他知道你究竟在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think you better take this back to Martyand let him know exactly what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.47,0:25:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道 我去查过档案了 我手里有文件 沃德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does. I've been down to the archives. I have the files, Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.41,0:25:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来谈谈康克林吧 - 你到底想查什么 帕姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's talk about Conklin. - What are you after, Pam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想炒了我吗？你想坐我的位子 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna fry me? You want my desk. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.85,0:25:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想知道发生了什么 - 发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna know what happened. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩 既然你手里有文件 我们就废话少说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne happened. you got the files. Then let's cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.79,0:25:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,康克林对他的手下要求非常严酷 所以这帮人几乎要崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conklin had these guys woundso tight, they were bound to snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.26,0:25:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩是他手下的头号杀手 有一次他接了个任务 搞砸了 再也没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne was his number-one. The guy went for ajob, screwed the op, never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.13,0:25:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,康克林没有办法 找不到伯恩 没法调整 事情越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conklin couldn 't fix it, couldn 't find Bourne, couldn 't adjust. It all went sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.31,0:26:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就杀了康克林？我的意思是 既然要废话少说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you had Conklin killed? I mean, If we're cutting the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里呆了30年 结了两次婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I 've given 30 years and two marriages to this agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.14,0:26:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在四块大陆上工作过 明年我就要退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've shoveled shit on four continents. I'm due to retire next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.11,0:26:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你认为我会坐在这里让你这么摆弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But If you think I'm gonna sit here and let you dangle me with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.22,0:26:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就见鬼去吧…还有马歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can go to hell… and Marshall too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩呢？他现在在哪儿？- 死在哪个臭水沟里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Bourne? Where is he now? - Deadin a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.39,0:26:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者在摩加迪沙的哪个酒吧里喝醉了 谁知道 - 我想我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drunk in a barin Mogadishu. Who knows? - I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周我在柏林的一笔生意砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a deal going down in Berlin last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易进行当中 我的人和卖家都被杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the buy, both our case officer and the seller were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手就是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were killed by Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.81,0:26:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等你上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ready for us upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.21,0:26:48.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中情局分局 英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,7年前 中情局有一笔两千万美元的资金 在经过莫斯科电汇的过程中不翼而飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven years ago, $20 million of C.I.A. funds disappeared during a wire transfer through Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.09,0:27:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在随后的调查中 一位名为弗拉迪米尔·奈斯基的俄国政客与我们联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the investigation that followed, wewere contacted by a Russian politician, Vladimir Neski.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.59,0:27:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈斯基称有人泄密 我们的钱被内部的人吞掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neski claimed we had a leak and that we'd been ripped off by one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.67,0:27:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这样吗？- 至今仍不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And were we? - We never found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.10,0:27:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当我们想约奈斯基先生会面时 他却被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were negotiating a meet with Mr. Neski when he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.47,0:27:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁干的？- 他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By who? - His wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.51,0:27:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件案子就这么一直搁着 直到上个月我们找到一个线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The case had gone cold until a month ago when we found a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个在柏林的俄国人声称 他有关于奈斯基被谋杀的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another Russian in Berlin who claimed to have access to the Neski murder files.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本以为又有希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we had another bite at the apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他却被我们自己的杀手杰森·伯恩杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out the assassin was one of our own…Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道「踩石」在这里不是个受欢迎的论题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Treadstone's not a very popular subject around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.86,0:28:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是随着调查的深入 我们发现了一些有趣的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we found some interesting things when we dug a little deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是康克林的个人电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Conklin's personal computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.86,0:28:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的「踩石」文件堆里塞满了 他既不需要也无权看到的解码密钥和案件档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Treadstone files are bloated with code keys and case files that he neither needed nor had clearance for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在硬盘里我们找到一个被删除的文件 其中有苏黎世银行的一个账号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried in the hard drive, we found a deleted file with an account number to a bank in Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.47,0:28:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死的时候 他的个人账户里有76万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time ofihis death, he was sitting on a personal account in the amount of $760, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他的经费预算吗？为了让他将事情保密 我们一直在砸钱给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what his budget was? We were throwing money at him and asking him to keep it dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是他自己的账户 他肯定干了些什么 - 你肯定这些情报确切么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was his own account. He was up to something. - This is supposed to be definitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.99,0:28:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经有两个人死在柏林了 这是肯定的 - 那你的结论是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's definitive is that I just lost two people in Berlin. - So what's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.96,0:28:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,康克林从坟墓里爬出来维护自己的名声？这个人已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conklin's reaching out from the grave to protect his good name? The man is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.60,0:28:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有人对此持有异议 沃德 - 帮帮忙 马蒂 你了解康克林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's disputing that, Ward. - For Christ's sake, Marty, you knew Conklin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.93,0:28:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这符合情理吗？根本不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this scan? I mean, at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接说重点 帕姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut to the chase, Pam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.97,0:28:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为伯恩和康克林是一伙儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that Bourne and Conklin were in business together,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.37,0:28:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然事情牵涉到伯恩 那么不管我在柏林想买的是什么情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Bourne's still involved and that whatever information I was trying to buy in Berlin…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都值得他重新现身杀人灭口\N{\fnArial\fs30}was big enough to bring Bourne out from hiding to kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这符合情理吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that scan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.85,0:28:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅 先生 您可能不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir, but you're not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.85,0:29:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩的护照刚刚在那不勒斯出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne's passport just popped up on the grid in Naples.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.99,0:29:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 接那不勒斯 他们得知道要对付的是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Contact Naples. They need to know who they're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.53,0:29:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我们在当地的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out what kind of local assets we have in place there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没事 有个家伙的名字出现在电脑上而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, it's nothing. Some guy's name came up on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.88,0:29:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 嗨 听着 汤姆 我过会儿给你打回去 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey, listen, Tom, I'm gonna call you back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.98,0:29:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.93,0:29:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩先生 我是约翰·内文斯 美国领事馆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bourne, I'm John Nevins. I'm with the U.S. Consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.03,0:29:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.98,0:30:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从丹吉尔来 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming out of Tangier. Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.46,0:30:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来那不勒斯的目的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the, uh, nature of yourvisit to Naples?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你干了什么 我也不知道你为谁工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what you did, and I don't know who you're working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.95,0:30:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我向你保证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise you this…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿就得遵守这边的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna play ball one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.66,0:30:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是内文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Nevins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.83,0:30:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是汤姆·克罗宁 中情局行动长官 从弗吉尼亚州兰利市打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Tom Cronin, C.I. Operations Officer calling from Langley, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.10,0:31:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是拘留了一个叫做杰森·伯恩的人？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a Jason Bourne in custody? - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.54,0:31:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 他是我们通缉的要犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, he's an agency priority target.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.31,0:31:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安置好他以后立刻给我打电话 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me back as soon as he's secure. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.46,0:31:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拘留了 这是号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been detained. Here's the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,领事馆的一名军官正在审问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being interrogated by a field officer out of the consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.08,0:32:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我是帕梅拉·兰蒂 中情局主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - This is Pamela Landy, C.I. supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.15,0:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 呃 我想他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, think he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.09,0:32:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.49,0:32:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有封锁该地区？- 封锁？没 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you locked down the area? - Locked it down? No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.23,0:32:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是 呃…这里是意大利 我们一般不封锁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, uh… This is Italy. They don't exactly lock down…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.36,0:32:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为机构工作了几年了？- 我？四年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long have you worked for the agency? - Me? For four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.87,0:32:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还想干第五年的话 就给我好好听着 伯恩身上有武器 极度危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever wanna make it to five, you're gonna listen to me real close. Bourne is armed and extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周他在柏林暗杀了两个人 其中一个是一名资深军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week in Berlin he assassinated two men… one a highly experienced field officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.11,0:32:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你确保该地区的安全 保护好所有的证据 立刻执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to secure that area. I want any evidence secured, and I want it done right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.91,0:32:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听懂了吗？- 是的 先生…不 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that clear? - Yes, sir… ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.92,0:32:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我45分钟后乘飞机去柏林 也就是说你要在30分钟内给我回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting on a plane to Berlin in 45 minutes, which means you're gonna call me back in 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.59,0:32:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我问起你情况如何的时候 你最好能给我个满意的答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I ask you where we stand, I had better be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.96,0:33:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柏林？- 我已经在那里准备了一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Berlin? - I already have a team in place there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑伯恩准备在那不勒斯成家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that Bourne's in Naples readyto start a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.50,0:33:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你根本不知道面对的是什么 - 你知道么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you have no idea what you're getting into. - Do you have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.47,0:33:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他离开「踩石」的那刻起 他杀掉和躲避了你派去寻找他的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the minute he left Treadstone, he's killed and eluded every single person that you've sent to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为自己读了几份关于杰森·伯恩的文件 就变成专家了吗？- 这是我的案子 沃德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you read a couple of files on Jason Bourne, and that makes you an expert? - This is my case, Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我要你们一起上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough. I want you both on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.21,0:33:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 所有的人 都要把这件以前懒得做的 或者没能力做的事情解决掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, all of us, going to do what we were either too lazy or inept to do the last time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.48,0:33:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找到这个杂种 把他干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find this son of a bitch and take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.75,0:33:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让杰森·伯恩继续嚣张下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I 'm not having Jason Bourne destroy any more of this agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.42,0:33:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们两个明白了吗？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that definitive enough for you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.36,0:33:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森·伯恩带有武器 极度危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason Bourne is armedand extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.17,0:33:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周他在柏林暗杀了两个人 其中一个是一名资深军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week in Berlin he assassinated two men… one a highly experienced field officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.97,0:33:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that area…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.74,0:33:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他暗杀了两个人… 一个是一名资深军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he assassinated two men… one a highly experienced field officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.47,0:33:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你确保该地区的安全 保护好所有的证据 立刻执行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that area secured. I want any evidence secured, and I want it done right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.83,0:34:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 这次不是训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.67,0:34:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 这次不是训练 士兵 这次不是训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill, soldier. This is not a drill, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.88,0:34:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚吗？清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We clear on that? We clear on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:18.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荷兰 阿姆斯特丹）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.85,0:35:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾在「踩石」工作了三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd been working at Treadstone for three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.49,0:35:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时的掩护身份是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your cover at the time was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.69,0:35:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎的一名美国学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was an American student in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.06,0:35:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在巴黎为「踩石」所做的工作具体包括什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what exactly did your job with Treadstone in Paris consist of?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.26,0:35:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两项职责 一是协调后勤行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had two responsibilities. One was to coordinate logistical operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.07,0:35:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,二是监视探员们的健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other was to monitor the health of the agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.90,0:35:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 健康？什么意思？- 精神健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Health, meaning what? - Their mental health.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.44,0:36:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为他们所经历的事情 他们很容易出现各种问题 - 哪种问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because of what they had been through, they were prone to a variety of problems. - What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.27,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,沮丧 愤怒 强制行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depression, anger, compulsive behaviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.84,0:36:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有身体上的症状 头疼 怕光\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had physical symptoms. Headaches, sensitivity to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.85,0:36:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 失忆症？- 伯恩之前？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amnesia? - Before Bourne? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机准备好了 车子正在等您\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plane's ready. There's a car waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.69,0:36:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你们好运 - 不 你是他在当地的联络人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck. - No. you were his local contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.76,0:36:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,康克林死的那晚你和他在一起 你要和我们一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were with him the night Conklin died. you're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.39,0:37:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰利方面从那不勒斯取得了一段影像 正在上传中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langley pulled an image out of Naples. It's uploading right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.53,0:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,传过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.64,0:37:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要获准 - 显然 他并没有躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need clearance. - He's not hiding, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.30,0:37:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么是那不勒斯？为什么是这个时候？- 可能是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why Naples? Why now? - Could be random.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.81,0:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他正在逃跑 - 用他自己的护照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he's running. - On his own passport?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.98,0:37:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底在干什么？- 他在犯第一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is he actually doing? - He's making his first mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会犯错 他们不会随意做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't make mistakes. They don't do random.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一个目的 一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always an objective. Always a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.49,0:37:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的和目标应该是从我们这里发出的 那现在是谁在给他发号施令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The objective and targets always came from us. Who's giving them to him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.46,0:38:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊弓之鸟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary version?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.86,0:38:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.21,0:38:11.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 慕尼黑）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.59,0:39:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 子弹已经被我拿掉了 - 怪不得感觉轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I emptied it. - It felt a little light.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.12,0:39:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.23,0:39:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前面 - 对不起 老习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Front. - Sorry. Old habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.17,0:39:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的牙 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your teeth. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.92,0:39:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说你失去记忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word in the etherwas you'd lost your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.92,0:39:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该搬家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still should've moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.53,0:39:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么？- 康克林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - Conklin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.43,0:39:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.43,0:39:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在巴黎被枪杀了 就在你出走的那天晚上死的 - 那现在谁负责「踩石」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shot dead in Paris. Dead the night you walked out. - So who's running "Treadstone" now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.24,0:39:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人 关门大吉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody. They shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.91,0:39:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都已经过去了 我们是最后的两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. We're the last two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.82,0:40:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 那他们为什么还在追捕我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's over, then Why are they still after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.12,0:40:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 听说过帕梅拉·兰蒂这个名字么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Ever heard the name Pamela Landy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.82,0:40:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没听说过 - 帕梅拉·兰蒂和柏林 柏林发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know who that is. - Pamela Landy and Berlin. What's going on in Berlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.03,0:40:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没必要撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.09,0:40:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是来杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were here to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.96,0:40:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd you do? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.13,0:40:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫人来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.34,0:41:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的车停在前面？- 钥匙在我上衣口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you have a car out front? - The keys are in my coat pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.74,0:41:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我们应该… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we should… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.75,0:41:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后面出去 我还有一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out the back. I have another car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.25,0:45:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.83,0:45:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有这个人 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nein, mein Herr. - Danke.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.40,0:46:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.77,0:46:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nein.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.22,0:46:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问有没有一位帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela Landy, bitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.15,0:46:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请接帕梅拉·兰蒂 - 请稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pamela Landy, please. - One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.56,0:46:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.29,0:46:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想打电话给一位客人 帕梅拉·兰蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to call a guest. Pamela Landy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.36,0:47:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.61,0:47:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 先生 现在对方电话占线 - 那过会儿再打吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, sir. The phone's busy right now. - Just try later. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.96,0:48:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们来看一下时间线 伯恩的目标是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's take a look at the timeline. What's Bourne's objective?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.03,0:48:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要把它分成几块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I wanna break this out in boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.73,0:48:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查从那不勒斯往外发出的 所有航班和火车 还有警察报告 这是第一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naples outbound. Check everything. Flights, trains, police reports. That's box one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.74,0:48:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰迪 这块归你 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teddy, that's yours. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.57,0:48:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二块 把它称为「重要联系」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Box number two. Call it "prior connections."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.07,0:48:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新看一遍伯恩的所有「踩石」材料 每个细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to rerun al I Bourne's T readstone material. Every footstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.45,0:48:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,基姆 第三块 我要你确定他的行动工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kim, box three. I want to identIf y his method ofitravel.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.32,0:48:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和当地警察保持联系 我们要找到某辆车 违章停车罚单什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on the local cops. We need a vehicle, a parking ticket, something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.65,0:48:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰利方面为我们提供了卫星成像系统 让我们找个目标出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langley's offered to upload any satellite imaging we need, so let's find a target for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.03,0:48:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 第四块 另外派些人手 重新检查一下我们丢失奈斯基文件的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, box four. I need fresh eyes. Review the buy where we lost the Neski files.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.30,0:48:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们对伯恩行踪的掌握标在时间线上 仔细检查 看看会有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timeline it with what we know about Bourne's movements. Turn it upside down and see what we find.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.30,0:48:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油干 伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.54,0:48:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家伙这么多年都生活在我们的完全掌控之下 我们应该能抢在他前头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran this guy's life with total control for all those years. We should be a step ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.11,0:48:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要回家吗？找到杰森·伯恩吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go home? Find Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.90,0:49:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕梅拉·兰蒂 - 我是杰森·伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pamela Landy. - This is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.47,0:49:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩？- 是伯恩 我们需要90秒钟才能确定他的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourne? - It's Bourne. We need 90 seconds to triangulate his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.11,0:49:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是你负责「踩石」吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you running Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.85,0:49:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「踩石」两年前就关闭了 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treadstone was closed down two years ago. you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.05,0:49:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在是谁在计划任务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who's planning the missions now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.72,0:49:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任务 已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no missions. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.73,0:49:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你们找我干什么？- 柏林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what do you want with me? - Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.57,0:49:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了在柏林发生过什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten what happened in Berlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.74,0:49:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了两个人 伯恩 你杀死了两个人 伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed two people, Bourne. you killed two people, Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.14,0:50:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了两个人 伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed two people, Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.31,0:50:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈斯基…弗拉迪米尔·奈斯基… 弗拉迪米尔·奈斯基…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neski… Vladimir Neski… Vladimir Neski…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.73,0:50:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.87,0:50:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 你想怎么过来？- 还要35秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. How do you wanna do it? - We need 35 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.37,0:50:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要一个我认识的人带我过来 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need someone I know to bring me in. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.18,0:50:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎有个女孩 她也参与了这个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a girl in Paris. She was part of the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是负责后勤的 亚历山大街 30分钟后 世界钟下见\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to handle logistics. Alexander Strasse, 30 minutes, under the World Clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.68,0:50:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她一个人去 把你的手机给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send her alone. Give her your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.92,0:50:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我找不到她呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What If I can't find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.26,0:50:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 她就站在你旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy. She's standing right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地区太多了… - 地形非常简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's just so many areas… - It's a very simple lay out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿二区的地图来 摊开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the second quadrant. Pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿？请把二区的地图拿来 摊开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Get the second quadrant, please. Pull it all the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.75,0:51:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大钟就在这儿… 妈的 她的位置就在正中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock is right here… Shit, he's put her in the middle of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.59,0:51:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法保护她的安全 在这里没办法掩护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a security nightmare. There is no way we are going to get her covered…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.59,0:51:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给柏林警察局打电话 我们需要狙击手 国防部 有什么都调过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a Mayday into Berlin station. We need snipers, D.O.D., whatever they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.53,0:51:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要狙击手 狙击手会把他吓跑的 我需要答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}No snipers. you put snipers on the roof and it'll scare him off, and I need answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.73,0:51:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你难道真的相信他要过来吗？- 他知道关于奈斯基的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you can't really believe he wants to come in. - He knows something about the Neski case.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.00,0:51:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会错过这次找出真相的机会的 - 别傻了 这次我们离他只有一步之遥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna pass up this chance to find out what it is. - Don't be a fool. Not when we're this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.87,0:51:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在讨论怎样保护妮基 还是怎样干掉伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we talking about protecting Nicky or killing Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.11,0:51:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在讨论怎样干掉伯恩 - 我们在讨论下一具尸体 可能是妮基 总会有人死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're talking about killing Bourne. - We're talking about the next dead body. It might be Nicky. It will be someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.28,0:51:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在听我说 如果伯恩死了 我什么都得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hearing me. Bourne dead gives me nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.92,0:51:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能私下和你谈谈么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you privately?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:52:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I know how you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.76,0:52:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在柏林牺牲了两个人 你希望他们死得其所\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost two men in Berlin and you want it to mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.43,0:52:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是伯恩给你的东西不可能让他们死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing Bourne gives you will bring your men back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.47,0:52:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些文件的内容不能弥补他们的死 你必须想开点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in those files makes their sacrifice worthwhile. you have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.94,0:52:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是专业人士 如果一次行动失败了 就得了结它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're professionals. When an operation goes bad, we tie it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.61,0:52:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还有什么没有告诉我的话 我希望你在我把那个女孩派出去之前告诉我 你明白么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's something you're not telling me, I want it now before I send that girl out there. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.15,0:52:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像是在纸上谈兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about this stuff like you read it in a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.60,0:52:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,您想怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.07,0:52:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让狙击手就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the snipers in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.31,0:52:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一情况有变 我们就干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If things go bad, we take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.08,0:53:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 这里是一队 过来了一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hub, this is Survey One. We have a crowd moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.19,0:53:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像是什么示威游行 - 对不起 我只能拉这么近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's some sort of protest march. - I'm sorry. This is as close as I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.49,0:53:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二队 你们能靠近些么？- 库尔特 保证南端的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Survey Two, can you get in any closer? - Kurt, make sure the south end is covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.49,0:53:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 是 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. Affirmative. Copythat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.61,0:54:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 有辆电车正朝你开过来 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - There's a tram coming towards you. Get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.22,0:54:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她正向电车移动 - 车开往哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's moving to the tram. - Where's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.15,0:54:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车开往亚历山大广场车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tram is going to Alexanderplatz Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.23,0:54:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,五队 我看不见他 我看不见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survey Five, I can't see him. I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.73,0:54:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 这里是二队 她要上电车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hub, this is Survey Two, she's getting on a tram.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.37,0:54:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要上电车了 - 放大电车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's getti ng on the tram. - Zoom in on the tram.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.51,0:54:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩在电车上 - 我认为他不在电车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourne's on the tram. - I don't think he's on the tram.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.24,0:54:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在电车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the tram.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.55,0:54:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人进去跟着 让他们保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send them in to follow. Tell them to keep their distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.02,0:54:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 德尔塔 我们走 上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Delta, let's go. Get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.05,0:54:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.42,0:54:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让她快一点 - 南边什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell herto hurry. - There's nothing on the south side.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.11,0:55:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大广场车站 25秒钟后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexanderplatz Station, 25 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.99,0:55:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是3队 这儿有很多示威人群 我们没办法掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Survey Three. There's a lot of protesters here. There's no way we can cover out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.03,0:55:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她带出来 - 快！德尔塔 快！立即行动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get her out of there. - Go! Delta, move! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.12,0:55:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不在这儿 她走了 - 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not here. She's gone. - Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.62,0:55:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没在电车上 - 他是一个人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are not on the tram. - He's one guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.92,0:55:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰森 请不要伤害我 - 我曾经说过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jason, please don't hurt me. - What were my words?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.30,0:55:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过别来惹我 别把我搅进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said leave me alone, leave me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.93,0:56:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么做的 我发誓 杰森 我告诉过他们我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. I swear. Jason, I told them that I believed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.50,0:56:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来问你几个简单的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask you some some simple questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.50,0:56:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要老实交待 否则我发誓一定杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna answer me honestly, or I swear to God I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.74,0:56:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德尔塔 快向我汇报情况 - 他们正在找！他们正在找！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Delta, give me something. - They're on it! They're on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.98,0:56:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉·兰蒂是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Pamela Landy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是一个特别行动组的负责人 - 现在是不是她在负责「踩石」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's a task force chief. - Is she running "Treadstone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.35,0:56:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 她是个副手 - 她为什么要杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, she's the deputy director. - Why is she trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.19,0:56:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个星期 她的手下跟一个线人进行一桩交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week an agency field officer tried to make a buy off one of her opps.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.26,0:56:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,线人好像原本打算出卖什么情报 但是让你捷足先登了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying to sell out a mole or something and you got to him before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.99,0:56:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我杀了他？- 你留下了指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I killed him? - you left a print.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.20,0:56:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们通过部分指纹查到了「踩石」 然后查到是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were partial prints that trace back to Treadstone. They know it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.27,0:56:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 荒谬 - 你为什么要这样做？为什么现在又回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is insane. - Why are you doing this? Why come back now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.04,0:56:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰蒂会找到… - 住口 住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Landy will find… - Stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.64,0:56:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个星期 我在4000英里外的印度 看着玛丽死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week I was 4, 000 miles away in India, watching Marie die.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.94,0:56:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来杀我的 却要了她的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came for me, and they killed her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.25,0:56:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.16,0:56:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要我干什么？你们为什么要陷害我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you people want with me? Why are you trying to frame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.19,0:57:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 我来这只是因为巴黎的事儿 是艾博特把我们拉来的… - 艾博特？谁是艾博特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! I'm only here because of Paris. Abbott dragged us… - Abbott? Who's Abbott?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,康克林的老板 是他…他关掉了「踩石」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conklin's boss. He-He shut down Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.00,0:57:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在在柏林吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he here in Berlin? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.87,0:57:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他负责「踩石」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he run "Treadstone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.87,0:57:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他负责「踩石」？- 是的 康克林是他的下属\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he run "Treadstone"? - Yes. Conklin reported to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.01,0:57:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你了 我发誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, I swear…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.01,0:57:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰蒂要买的是什么东西？什么样的情报？- 康克林…有关康克林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was Landy buying? What kind of files? - Conklin… Stuff on Conklin.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.18,0:57:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像和一个俄国政客有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was something to do with a Russian politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.65,0:57:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奈斯基 - 什…什么？你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neski. - Wh-What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.76,0:57:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练结束…训练结束… 训练结束…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training is over… Training is over… Training is over…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.80,0:57:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我什么时候来过柏林？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When… When was I here in Berlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.10,0:57:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 我曾经在这儿为「踩石」执行过一次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - For Treadstone. You know my file. I did a job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.47,0:57:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候？- 不 你以前从没在柏林执行过任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - No, you never worked in Berlin before.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.04,0:57:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第一次任务 在柏林 你知道我的档案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}my first job. In Berlin. I did a job here. You know my file.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.44,0:57:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从没在柏林执行过任务 - 我的第一次任务！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you've never worked Berlin before. - my first job!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.38,0:57:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你的第一次任务是在日内瓦 - 你们这帮混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, your first assignment was Geneva. - you fucking people!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.15,0:57:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓！我发誓！- 我知道我来过这里 妮基！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I swear! I swear! - I know I was here, Nicky!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的档案里没有！- 我知道我来过这儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not in your file! - I know I was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.55,0:58:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我发誓…哦 求你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Iswear… Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.27,0:58:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕姆 你看 这是亚历山大广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pam, I want to show you something. It's Alexanderplatz.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.74,0:58:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共三层 15条隧道 向外辐射到半径5个街区的范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got three levels, we got 15 tunnels. They're all converging in a five-block radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.71,0:58:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 拉夫茨舒尔兹地堡 是一个旧的战时避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, Luftschulzbunker. That was an old war shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.78,0:58:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面有多少人？- 两个正从后面楼梯下来 其余的成扇形搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many men are out there? - Two coming down the back stairs. The rest, they're fanned out for a search.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.25,0:58:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这的安全状况如何？- 哪里？「这里」？地面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's our security situation here? - Where, "here"? The ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.09,0:58:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里 就这栋楼 - 检查所有一切 楼梯、走廊和其它所有地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here here. In the building. - Check everything, and recheck all the stairwells, hallways, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.16,0:58:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.63,0:58:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 索性公开吧 把他的照片交给柏林警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go public. Release his photo to the Berlin police.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.13,0:58:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要查一下他在印度的女友 - 我马上去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And check out his story about the girlfriend in India too. - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.57,0:58:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你麻烦大了 帕梅拉 而且你没法摆平\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a big puddle of shit, Pamela, and you don't have the shoes for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.48,0:58:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说他不知道任何有关柏林的事情 - 他知道妮基戴着窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He said he didn't know anything about Berlin. - He knew that Nicky was wearing a wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.48,0:59:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你难道不觉得他是故意那么说的吗？- 听起来他不像是个被我控制的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you think that was for our benefit? - He didn't sound like a man in control to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.42,0:59:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道他来过柏林\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know he was in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.75,0:59:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脑子坏了！是我们搞坏的 而且现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mind is broken. We broke it. And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.12,0:59:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么样？干掉他？自从我们来这里以后你一直急着想要干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now? Terminate him? you've been pushing that agenda ever since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.22,0:59:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还说你负责「踩石」 我们也应该相信这个么？- 我确信伯恩知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He also said you were running Treadstone. Should we believe that too? - I'm convinced Bourne knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.83,0:59:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你在找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that you're after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.90,0:59:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他知道自我保护 你也应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the interest of self-preservation you might start with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.43,0:59:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查一下那些照片 他们走了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check on those photos. Have they gone out?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.15,0:59:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些东西给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.32,1:01:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这块的工作已经做完了 但是在向兰蒂汇报之前 我想先给您看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I finished my box work, but I wanted to show you before I showed Landy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.86,1:01:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我又来这儿看了一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came down here last night…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.36,1:01:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我觉得这里有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}because none of this is making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.37,1:01:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意你的看法…康克林是个疯子 但如果说他是叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you… Conklin was a nut. But a traitor?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.87,1:01:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不敢苟同 - 你发现什么了 丹尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just can't get there. - What do you have, Danny?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.70,1:01:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 在这里放上炸药 就会摧毁大厦的电力系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you put a four-gam Kel on here, it's gonna take out power to the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.17,1:01:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.74,1:01:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有两个爆炸装置 本该同时引爆的 而这边这个并没有爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were two charges that were supposed to go off simultaneously. The second one, over here, didn't go off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.58,1:01:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 这条线没用 这是上面那个断路器的副线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, first of all, this is nothing. It's a sub-line for the breaker above.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.59,1:01:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 为什么要在这儿放上第二个爆炸装置？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second, Why put the charge all the way down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.09,1:01:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有本事进来安放炸弹 你应该知道这个爆炸装置是没必要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're good enough to get in here and handle the gear, you're good enough to know you don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.86,1:02:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne would know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.83,1:02:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是故意弄成这样的？- 看起来像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was staged? - Is it a slam dunk? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.40,1:02:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人想通过诬陷康克林和伯恩 来掩盖自己的罪行呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what If somebody were trying to cover their tracks by blaming Conklin and Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.37,1:02:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是伯恩根本和这件事没有关系呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What If Bourne didn't have anything to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.37,1:02:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再演示一遍 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show me again. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.68,1:02:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你把…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you put…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.67,1:02:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停车 他要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over. He's getting out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.98,1:02:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵 这次不是训练 清楚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a drill, soldier. We clear on that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.41,1:02:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可是来真的 行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a live project, and you're a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.15,1:03:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在另一头会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I 'll see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 先生 需要帮忙吗？- 我想要个房间过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, sir. How can I help you? - I want to get a room for the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.64,1:03:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您预订了吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a reservation? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.49,1:03:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我想住645房间 我以前在那住过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, is room 645 available? I've stayed there before.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.16,1:03:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 先生 那个房间已经有人了 644怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir. That room is occupied. How about room 644?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.73,1:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在645对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right across the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.34,1:03:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 644？- 好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 644? - That's fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.64,1:03:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示您的护照 在这里签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need your passport and signature right here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.21,1:04:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您晚间愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.78,1:04:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.11,1:05:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏林警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berlin Polizei.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.63,1:05:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿？- 布莱克酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Brecker Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们马上就到 把车开过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're there. Take the van!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.13,1:05:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱克酒店？多远？- 大概5、6分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brecker? How far? - About five or six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.67,1:06:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.81,1:06:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.08,1:06:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.02,1:06:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.83,1:07:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polizei! Polizei!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.81,1:07:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.71,1:08:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色外套 可能是皮的 黑色T恤 黑色裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black coat, possibly leather, dark T-shirt, dark pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.64,1:08:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察要把所有客人集中 一个一个检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops out there wanna corral all the guests together and check 'em out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.08,1:08:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will really work.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.85,1:08:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到这里来干什么？- 也许只是想过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell's he doing here? - Maybe he just wanted to stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.96,1:09:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polizei!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.57,1:09:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polizei! Polizei!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.21,1:09:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polizei! Polizei!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.35,1:10:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polizei! Polizei!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.94,1:12:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没抓到？- 是的 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They missed him? - Yeah, so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.94,1:12:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们发现了妮基 她回维斯丁了 伯恩把她放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they found Nicky. She's back at the Westin. Bourne let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.95,1:12:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她放了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He let her go? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.25,1:12:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼·索恩在哪儿？他应该过去给她录口供的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Danny Zorn? He ought to head over there and debrief her.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.42,1:12:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩为什么来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Bourne come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.22,1:12:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道 兰蒂在上面的一个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know yet. Landy's upstairs in one of the rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.52,1:12:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说完事后给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she'd call you when she's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.66,1:12:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.07,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…我还是打车回酒店吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll, uh… take a cab back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.88,1:12:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 他住的是大厅对面的那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the room he checked into was across the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.55,1:12:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.58,1:12:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么到这来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he come in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在想什么？- 我认得这房间 在哪张照片上见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you thinking? - I recognize this room from a photo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.30,1:13:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾经是一句尸体的粉笔轮廓线 弗拉迪米尔·奈斯基的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a chalk outline right here around the body of Vladimir Neski.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.57,1:13:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妻子就是在这杀了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where his wife killed him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.74,1:13:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还认为是他妻子杀了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still think his wife killed him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.82,1:13:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能是从这个窗子出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess he got out through this window.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.52,1:13:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚从柏林警方得到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got word from the Berlin police.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.52,1:13:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现了丹尼·索恩的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found Danny Zorn's body.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.36,1:13:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们俩继续查伯恩 检查所有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you two to stay on Bourne. Check everything that's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.50,1:13:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给艾博特 告诉他在酒店等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Abbott. Tell him to wait for me in his hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.07,1:13:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.73,1:14:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Da. - It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.44,1:14:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始查奈斯基的案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're onto Neski.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.74,1:14:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个电话不安全 - 没有伯恩他们什么都证明不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not a clean phone. - They can't prove anything without Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.94,1:14:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了伯恩 才能终止这次调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Bourne, and you kill this investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.91,1:14:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃德 恐怕我们该分道扬镳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid, Ward, the time has come for us to part company.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.45,1:14:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 尤里 你偷了中情局两千万美元 的种子基金才买到了那些油田的租用权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Yuri, you bought those oil leases with 20 million in stolen C.I.A. seed money.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.12,1:14:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你欠我的 - 你那份我已经给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you owe me. - I gave you your cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.59,1:14:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都发了财\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both got rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.83,1:14:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不欠你任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't owe you anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.99,1:14:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划还有拯救的希望 只要干掉伯恩 你听到没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan can still be salvaged. Just get Bourne. you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.63,1:14:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still out there. Now get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.63,1:14:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉杰森…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Jason…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.39,1:15:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我叫救命没有用吧 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose it would do me much good to cry for help, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.39,1:15:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.63,1:15:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.30,1:15:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.30,1:15:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.17,1:15:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些文件会把我和奈斯基的谋杀案联系到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were files linking me to the Neski murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.17,1:15:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些文件不见了 而他们怀疑是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the files disappeared and they suspected you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.71,1:15:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们永远都查不出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd be chasing a ghost for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.38,1:15:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我们碍了你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.38,1:15:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此你们杀了奈斯基？还有玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Why Neski died? Is that Why you killed Marie?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.82,1:15:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了玛丽…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Marie…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.82,1:15:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你上她的车的那一刻起\N{\fnArial\fs30}the minute you climbed into her car.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.82,1:15:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你进入她的生活的那一刻起 她就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The minute you entered her life, she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.83,1:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过让你们别来惹我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you people to leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.83,1:15:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我洗手不干了 躲到了半个地球以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell off the grid. I was halfway around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.33,1:16:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说没有哪个地方是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no place it won't catch up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.23,1:16:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个故事的结局都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how every story ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.70,1:16:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森… 你注定是一个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you are, Jason… a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.27,1:16:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.51,1:16:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧 来吧！来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Go on. Go on! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.78,1:16:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会让我这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want me to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.32,1:16:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你活下来的唯一理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.33,1:17:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个爱国者 我为我的国家服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a patriot. I serve my country.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.67,1:17:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼·索恩呢？他又是什么？- 他运气不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And DannyZorn? What was he? - Unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.77,1:17:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个附属牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.58,1:17:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.95,1:17:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死而无憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.34,1:18:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用了 他一到就给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, forget it. Call me as soon as he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.31,1:19:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.05,1:19:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同步做得很好 - 这个人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good synch-up. - Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.48,1:19:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,B站台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plat form "B."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.72,1:19:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧 来吧！来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Go on. Go on! Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.89,1:19:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会让我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want me to.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.49,1:19:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你活下来的唯一理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.47,1:19:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰利来了个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a call from Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.47,1:19:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在检查艾博特的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're, uh, going through Abbott's records,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.48,1:19:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔想知道伯恩怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Marshall wants to know what's going on with Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.75,1:19:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 泰迪 泰迪 这是谁？看这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Teddy. Teddy, who's this? Look at this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.08,1:19:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正要上车… 就在那儿！那儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He 's about to enter… Right there! There!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.25,1:19:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那儿 是伯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ri ght through there. That's Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.59,1:19:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快下来！我们有发现了！- 我们发现伯恩了！快来看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down here! We got something! - We got a sighting! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.76,1:19:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 我把图像传到大监视器上 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. I got it on the big monitor. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.76,1:19:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.43,1:19:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 好 慢一点 他刚进入画面 - 是那件衣服 是他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, whoa. Hold on. He's just entered frame. - It's the coat. That's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.23,1:19:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪趟火车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What train is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.90,1:20:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开往莫斯科的 - 他去莫斯科干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the train to Moscow. - Why the hell would he go to Moscow?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.54,1:20:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我接俄国内务部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the Russian interior ministry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.15,1:20:12.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄罗斯 莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.73,1:20:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话关了 到底发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.09,1:21:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我有一个月的假期
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.79,1:21:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我杰森·伯恩死了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.84,1:22:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能带我到这个地方么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.77,1:22:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢布？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.04,1:22:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,美元
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.79,1:22:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快行动 34号出租车… 刚离开火车站
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.55,1:23:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.97,1:23:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.71,1:24:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美国人 是么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.75,1:24:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.90,1:24:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找住在48号的女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.93,1:24:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈斯基家的女孩？她不住这儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.27,1:24:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从这座城市搬走了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.81,1:24:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是奥兰尼公寓 16号
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.89,1:25:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特工！我是特工！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.39,1:27:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.99,1:27:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.92,1:27:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 离我的车远点 笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.10,1:29:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要FSB支援 高速追击
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.86,1:35:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 别出声好么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.77,1:36:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有钱 也没有毒品 你想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.75,1:36:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 坐下
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.39,1:36:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在椅子上
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.49,1:36:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会说英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak English.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.29,1:36:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.03,1:36:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.77,1:36:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're older.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.12,1:36:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想像的还要大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Older than I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.22,1:37:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.80,1:37:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说很重要吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean a lot to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.47,1:37:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 只是一张照片而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing. It's just a picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.57,1:37:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.41,1:37:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不知道他们是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause you don't know how they died.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.81,1:37:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.08,1:37:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.59,1:37:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.26,1:37:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道 我… 我妈妈没有杀死我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would want to know that my … that my mother didn't kill my father,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.37,1:37:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she didn't kill herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.37,1:37:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.71,1:37:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母并不是那么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what happened to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.05,1:38:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.36,1:38:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.53,1:38:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.10,1:38:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.87,1:38:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲本该是一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was supposed to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.81,1:38:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的母亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then your mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.08,1:38:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}came out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.09,1:38:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好改变计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I had to change my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.36,1:38:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情因此而改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changes things,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.03,1:38:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成你所知道的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.04,1:38:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.38,1:39:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你的所爱从你身边被夺走时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When what you love gets taken from you,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.55,1:39:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wanna know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.04,1:39:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.20,1:40:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕梅拉·兰蒂 - 我听说你还在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pamela Landy. - I hear you're still looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.11,1:40:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯恩？- 你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourne? - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.85,1:40:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想谢谢你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to thank you…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.88,1:40:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那盘磁带\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.08,1:40:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了我要的东西 一切都结束了…结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got what we needed. It's all tied off… It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.86,1:40:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我该向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.06,1:40:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是官方的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that official?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.33,1:41:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是私下的 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Off the record. you know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.53,1:41:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.93,1:41:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.71,1:41:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·韦伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}David Webb.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.71,1:41:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是你的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your real name.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.71,1:41:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出生在1971年4月15日 在密苏里州的涅克萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born 4-15-71 in Nixa, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.62,1:41:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不过来谈谈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come in and we'll talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.16,1:41:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.40,1:41:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该休息一下了 帕姆 你看起来很累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest, Pam. you look tired.
